":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11696697","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-11-30","type":"results_due","what":"下一季 (9 月底结束) 季报最迟公布日 · 交易所规定","what_en":"Deadline for the quarter ending Sep (Bursa rule)","src":"rule"},{"date":"2026-12-02","type":"corporate","what":"供股认购截止日","what_en":"Rights acceptance deadline","ann":"11696697","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11696697","src":"ai"},{"date":"2026-12-02","type":"agm","what":"第41届常年股东大会","what_en":"41st AGM","ann":"11694261","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11694261","src":"ai"}],"recent_en":"Ekovest is proceeding with a renounceable rights issue of up to 1.78 billion new shares at RM0.20 each on a 3-for-5 basis, approved by shareholders at an EGM on 30 October 2026. The company has also secured RM1.025 billion in financing from MBSB for the DUKE highway network expansion. In the latest quarter ended 30 June 2026, revenue rose 15.2% QoQ but net loss widened to RM94.49 million.","notable_en":["Proposed renounceable rights issue of up to 1,779,246,481 new shares at RM0.20 each on a 3-for-5 basis, approved by shareholders at an EGM.","Signed a RM1.025 billion financing facility with MBSB Group for DUKE highway network expansion.","41st Annual General Meeting scheduled for 2 December 2026."],"risks_en":["The rights issue of up to 1.78 billion new shares at RM0.20 each may dilute existing shareholders' stakes.","Net loss widened to RM94.49 million in the latest quarter, with a net loss margin of 56.2%."],"earnings_en":"For the quarter ended 30 June 2026, revenue was RM168.01 million, up 15.2% QoQ but down 16.6% YoY; net loss was RM94.49 million with a net loss margin of 56.2%, wider than 51.8% in the previous quarter."}